# Everything the stages in Dockerfile read is the tree minus build output, local packages and
# documentation; ui/dist is the dashboard stage's output. harness/ stays, because the check
# stage builds its Rust half. The build reads Dockerfile itself, so leaving it out of the
# context keeps an edit to one stage from invalidating every COPY.
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
target
.git
.amp
docs
openspec
**/node_modules
ui/dist
**/*.log
**/__pycache__
